      "title": "File:Bald Cypress Tress in Congaree National Park (52880948464).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/27/Bald_Cypress_Tress_in_Congaree_National_Park_%2852880948464%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
